        "text": "# Yet Again\n\n**Author:** \n\n**Published:** 2026-09-14\n\n**Categories:** \n\n**Tags:** \n\n**Source:** https://blog.billymacdeus.com/\n\n---\n\nWe are growing old\nYet again the night wind was so cold\nIt left me feeling blue\nAll the more because I needed you\nTo draw my destiny\nWith full mutiny\nAnd distinctive veiny\nStars I cannot see\nOriginal Content Poetry by\nSilver\n#submissions\n#pinoyPoets\n",
